WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.060
I'm begging you-tori!

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:09.070
Please prepare the stage for my Fuwari's team formation ceremony one more time-tori!

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.020
Most certainly.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.530
Please note that the fee for renting the venue is due to the manager!

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:22.130
I've made it all the way to Parajuku,
but I can't get hold of a venue for the ceremony...

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.840
I <i>knew</i> I was the bird of unhappiness-tori...

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.340
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.390
Paradise: Our goal.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.830
I wish Hibiki-san could say her part as well...

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.020
Yes.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.860
The third Divine Idol Grand Prix, the Divine Shoes Competition,

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:48.730
will begin momentarily.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.060
And the teams competing are...

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.390
SoLaMi SMILE!

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.730
Dressing Pafé!

00:00:58.690 --> 00:00:59.770
And Garmageddon!

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.690
Our current eligible teams are these three!

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.290
I love you, SoLaMi SMILE!

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.770
Oh yeah, Garmageddon!

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.430
Hibiki's team...

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.050
I suppose they didn't make it in the end...

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:18.340
They couldn't complete the formation ceremony, and they didn't all get a Super Cyalume Coord either-usa...

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.800
What a shame-kuma...

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:22.660
We didn't get our other team members in time...

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.420
But you'll enter next time-ucha!

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:28.760
Yep! And until the day I can destroy her...

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.440
Go for it, Onee-chan!

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.300
Capisce!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.140
Go for it, everyone-usa!
Go for it, everyone-kuma!

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.280
We'll pri-each for the stars!

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.320
Thank you!

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.200
We're revving the tension straight to max!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:42.810
<i>Go</i>!

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:43.340
Yeah!

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:44.920
Devil...

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:45.900
and angel!

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.380
And Garuru-garu!

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.210
Here we go!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.070
Pri-pri-pri!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.060
Decisive victory!

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.350
I don't like this at all!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.890
I have to get to Parajuku as soon as possible!

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.280
Capisce!

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.970
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.100
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.300
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.870
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.900
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:01.710
The Grand Prix's already started-tori...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.800
We didn't make it after all-tori...

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.300
That's okay.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.020
Tori! Unicorn-san?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.230
Why are you here?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.300
There'ch no "why" about it!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.920
Listen, Maho-shan!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.970
Falulu was born from everyone'ch dreams!

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:26.850
So becoming a Divine Idol is her life'ch purpose!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:30.410
And just what are <i>you</i> doing to help her?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.160
You can't say the oath or complete the ceremony –

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:37.010
and you don't even have a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:41.150
I'd thought you'd make a good match for Falulu cause you were some celebrity,

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:44.110
but you're just some useless loser! You're beyond help!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.590
Unicorn...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:51.380
Do you realise it'ch <i>your</i> fault Falulu can't enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix?

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.060
Yeah, I realise.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.200
You're infuriating!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.940
Can you hear your own half-flanked, unashamed drivel?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.770
I've had it up to here with you!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.230
You're getting the horn!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:02.440
Unicorn?!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.240
Hibiki-san!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.170
Andou!

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.420
Andou! Speak to me!

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.800
I'm... all right...

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.900
Hibiki-sama...

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.460
I was protected by these.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.290
Goat Tickets?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:37.190
In order to ensure you could complete the formation ceremony at any time, I cleared all obstacles in your path.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.290
I lured Kiki Ajimi-sama and trapped her in a drawing room.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.440
So much blank drawing paper-Da Vinci!

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.530
It sends a shiver thr-ubens my artist's soul!

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:00.130
It was then that I received...

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:06.010
And that's how you miraculously evaded demise at the hands of Unicorn-san's horn?

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.930
Friend Tickets are really strong!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.100
And, Hibiki-san, you're a strong person too.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:24.040
I'm honoured to have been of service to you, Hibiki-sama.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.560
Tch – darned meddling goat.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.990
My horn'ch smarting now because of you.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.600
Unicorn!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.700
<i>Thank you for waiting!</i>

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:41.020
<i>The order of the performers has been decided by lottery!</i>

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.420
<i>First up:</i>

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.990
<i>The winners of the second round, Garmageddon!</i>

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.130
<i>Gel-gel-angel!</i>

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.420
<i>Garuru's gonna do her best!</i>

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:55.170
Unicorn, we'll be fine. You should go and watch Garuru's performance!

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.490
Falulu...

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:57.730
But then...

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.860
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.970
But this is really important for Garuru!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.440
So please!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.860
You've... really grown up, Falulu...

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:13.910
Okay! I'll watch over Garuru for the both of us!

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:18.720
Man, this useless loser'ch really messed this up!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.620
Yep, she'ch sure useless, all right!

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.760
You're not useless, Maho-chan.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.650
Don't push yourself, okay?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:30.120
I don't like seeing you sad.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:40.920
Falulu...

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.540
You do want to enter the Grand Prix, don't you?

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.560
No, it's not like that.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.570
But you carry the dreams of all girls.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.400
Weren't you born to become a Divine Idol?

00:07:58.510 --> 00:07:59.410
<i>Me too...</i>

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.410
<i>I want to be an idol!</i>

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.730
<i>A wonderful idol...</i>

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:02.930
<i>A sparkling idol!</i>

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:04.240
<i>A shining idol!</i>

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:04.750
<i>Me too!</i>

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:05.480
<i>Me too!</i>

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.290
<i>I want to do it!</i>

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:14.900
<i>Falulu was born from everyone'ch dreams!</i>

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:17.640
<i>So becoming a Divine Idol is her life'ch purpose!</i>

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.330
That's what I wanted at first,

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.260
but now...

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.410
You and Maho-chan are most important to me!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.720
I'm coming, Garuru; just wait for me!

