Starting the Coord Change.

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:52.510
Our top batters, Garmageddon, are of course kitted out in their Love Devi coords!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.820
Garmageddon...

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:54.830
