00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.070
They're not bad.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.630
Garuru'ch the best.

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:27.070
Making Drama, switch on!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.340
Garu!

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:31.960
Onward!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:32.980
Geru!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.200
Garu!

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:42.760
Mischievous Macaroon Factory!

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.240
