00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:52.790
Super Cyalume Change!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.290
Devi!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.070
Geru!

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:00.970
Garu!

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:15.410
Curse me, Aroma!

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:17.000
Mikan, that was delicious!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.820
Bite me, Garuru!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.260
They're so cute it hurts!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:23.450
They're worthy opponents-pri.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.030
<i>Go</i>! They're full of pep and vinegar!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:27.500
They were shining really bright!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.590
Sure, why not?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.120
Wow! That was amazing, Garuru!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.070
You were great!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.600
Hibiki-san...

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:37.740
Hibiki-san!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.010
Are you going to give up here?

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.330
I don't want that!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:46.130
I know you can do anything you set your mind to!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.810
Don't you worry, Fuwari.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.420
