00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.670
I will revive CelePara!

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:57.490
No, stop!
I will revive CelePara!

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.030
No, stop!

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.100
I will revive CelePara!

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:11.490
Eh?

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:12.600
No, stop!

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:13.650
Hibiki-san!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.630
Hibiki-san, you jerk!

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.020
I didn't think you could be such a coward!

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.090
Fuwari...

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.050
