00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.260
Fuwari! What are you doing-tori?

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.640
Hold on, Fuwari-tori!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.730
Toriko-san!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:36.670
Hibiki-san's been practicing hard by herself to try to say the words of the oath-tori!

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:40.040
I saw her-tori...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:42.250
Promise:

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.320
Believe in fr...

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.440
Promise:

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:46.890
Believe in frie...

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.020
It was painful, but she tried again and again,

00:12:56.020 --> 00:13:00.450
but she couldn't. And she worried about it.
She was really unfortunate-tori!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.820
As the blue bird of unhappiness...

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:09.070
I understand that kind of misfortune all too well-tori!

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:11.180
Hibiki-san and I have suffered together!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.320
Don't lump me with you.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:15.940
Anyway, don't be so hard on her-tori!

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.250
Hibiki-san... is that true?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.400
You know I'd never do something so undignified.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.280
I don't believe you!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.800
I'm sorry...

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:32.760
I <i>knew</i> you were having a hard time, and I still...

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:35.970
only said things that made it worse.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.490
It was for me...

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.700
