00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.000
Thank you, Fuwari.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:49.690
Falulu...

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.570
You three are already a real team-tori!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.690
Very well.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:02.620
Maho-chan?

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:07.600
Is that...

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.200
