00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.090
And me.

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:44.290
Me too!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:48.930
The Divine Idol Grand Prix is underway –
what do you think you're doing here?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.920
Meganee's holding a special show, so we're capisce and dandy!

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.060
