00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:07.330
You're finally ready.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.020
Yes!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.140
Well, then, let's begin the ceremony!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.250
Tori...

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:15.870
Tricolore members Hibiki, Falulu and Fuwari,

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.410
