00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.830
What'ch that?

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.600
But Fuwari and Falulu are friends!

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.690
Hibiki-san...

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:00.680
Maho-chan...

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.030
