00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.550
The words of the oath have been accepted.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.530
Is that really all right?

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:20.250
Yes.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:26.000
The sincerity in Hibiki-san's words has cleared the system.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.120
Way to go!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.390
Hii! Hii!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.960
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.820
Paradise: Our goal.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.740
We swear to stand on stage as one!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.310
Congratulations!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.010
It's so beautiful-tori!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.010
Hibiki-sama... will you snap with me?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.360
I will snap with no goat.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.080
You finally did it!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.740
Now let's go perform!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.500
Tricolore...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.540
completed the ceremony?

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.600
And they're performing?

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:04.670
Hibiki-sama?

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:05.440
Wow!

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.750
I want to see it!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.650
I'm going to see it!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.820
I've just gotta see it!

