00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.660
We've gotta win!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.200
We will stand above all!

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:31.790
For you! A mysterious spring pristine rhapsody!

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.930
Cyalume Change!

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.330
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.370
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.660
Much obliged.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:18.500
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:22.530
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:44.930
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:47.420
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.900
Wow, that was amazing!

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:03.940
My goodness. You certainly are a handful, little baby.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.340
You can still enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix if you choose.

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:09.950
Really? We can?

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:10.390
What?

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.200
Tori!

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.850
Now, let us go!

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:15.290
Very well!

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:15.470
Yes!

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:15.970
Yeah!

00:22:16.450 --> 00:22:19.940
Here we go!

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.740
I've kept you waiting, haven't I?

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.100
But it is now time.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:57.040
We, Tricolore, shall teach you just what is

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.200
an idol, a star, a <i>god</i>!

00:23:59.200 --> 00:23:59.850
Naa.

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:02.080
Hibiki-sama, we should make haste in order to enter.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.500
Don't fret so, Andou.

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:07.130
We should let our opening act have a chance to dream of victory first.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:08.510
We're no opening act!

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:10.130
We're not gonna let you beat us!

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.700
You sure talk big for someone who barely made it here!

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:13.290
Hmph.

00:24:13.570 --> 00:24:17.020
Next time, <i>Ring Out! Divine Idol Grand Prix!</i>

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
